If task SRFR-022 has already landed, the handler lives at
`src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/services/FieldMappingHandler.ts`.
If not, the handler is still at its pre-move location under the
AssociationResolver PCF. Update the reference in place regardless of location.

New docstring reference:
  "See `projects/set-regarding-and-field-mapping-resolver-r1/spec.md#appendix-a-field-mapping-subsystem-spec` for the subsystem contract."
  (If Appendix A has been promoted into `docs/architecture/…` by execution
