Additionally, add a short "Field Mapping subsystem" pointer entry to
`docs/architecture/README.md` (if that catalog file exists) so future
maintainers can find the Appendix A contract from a repo-level index.

No behavior change. Docstring / documentation only.
  ]]></prompt>

  <role>Documentation maintainer familiar with docstring conventions in TypeScript service files and repo-level architecture catalog authoring.</role>

